  "description": "21 World Cup wins and counting, but we never settle – the TUES lineage is proof of that. Born from competition, rivalry, and our unstoppable pursuit of speed, it’s a bike that reigned supreme from its debut. Now evolved, the MK4 results from chasing perfection; this is a platform designed to carve out split seconds and perform at the highest level. This CORE 4 model is inspired by the YT MOB, and with it, we hold nothing back. FOX Factory suspension powers its performance, and with SRAM X01 shifting, powerful TRP DH-R EVO brakes, and Industry Nine hubs, it lays down race-hardened levels of control to maximize your efforts on the track. Time waits for no one, but with the TUES CORE 4, the odds are always in your favor.MX or 29\" – with FLIP LINK, you choose both. The new TUES is both MX and 29\" capable without the need for additional frame parts.",
